  <data name="About_Disclaimer" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Daily Plants is an independent app, not affiliated with or endorsed by Dr. Michael Greger or NutritionFacts.org. The checklists are an aspirational guide, not a meal plan or medical advice, so adapt them to your needs. Talk to your doctor before making big changes, especially if you are pregnant, breastfeeding or have a medical condition. For children, ask a doctor or dietitian.</value>
